 * Created with FPGA Pixel Font Maker
 *
 * Description:
 * Variable width font.
 * First byte of the letter is its width.
 *
 * Parameters:
 * ROWS PER LETTER = 16;    (power of 2, including width row)
 * BYTES PER ROW = 1;       (defines max letter width and word size for memory)
 * LETTER HEIGHT = 11;      ( =< ROWS PER LETTER - 1)
 *
 */

